+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Commands
+
+* `init`, `generateReports`, `updateConfig`: create, run and refresh the analysis of a single repository
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or updates a landscape report (`<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape/`), aggregating the results of multiple analyses found under the analysis root. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands.
+* `updateLandscape`: the previous name of `analyzeLandscape`; same behaviour and options, kept for existing scripts
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command.
\ No newline at end of file
